{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 4376W  Rathbones Group PLC  25 September 2026   Rathbones Group Plc (the \"Company\")Notification of Transactions of Persons Discharging Managerial ResponsibilitiesThe Company announces that the following PDMR has been granted a share award under the Rathbones Group Plc Performance Share…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 4376W  Rathbones Group PLC  25 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["Rathbones Group Plc (the \"Company\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notification of Transactions of Persons Discharging Managerial Responsibilities"]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company announces that the following PDMR has been granted a share award under the Rathbones Group Plc Performance Share Plan 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["The details below relate to a Deferred Share Award granted on 9 March 2026. The grant was delayed pending completion of the FCA Skilled Person Review, which was ongoing at the time."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Deferred Share Award will vest over a three-year period in three equal annual tranches. The award was made at a share price of £20.27, £19.13, and £18.00, based on the average share price over five days preceding the grant date and discounted to reflect the absence of dividend equivalents over the annual vesting cycle. The award is subject to Company's malus and clawback provisions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The notifications below, which have been made in accordance with the requirements of the UK Market Abuse Regulation, provide further detail."]},{"type":"p","children":["Enquiries:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Ali Johnson"]},{"type":"p","children":["Group Company Secretary"]},{"type":"p","children":["Telephone - 07901 118456"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notification and public disclosure of transactions by persons discharging managerial responsibilities and persons closely associated with them"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-r